  "sourceTitle": "Qwengram-0.8B: I transferred Qwen3.8 Flash-Next’s n-gram memory into Qwen3.5-0.8B — 5.05% lower validation perplexity",
  "sourceBodyHash": "0adec0730a0e11f27d363d43a2b609c8a30e66e084ef6cb2a1eecb32af8cb0ba",
