  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T03:11:36.847630Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T03:24:09.671546Z",
  "totalBlocks": 27,
  "translatedBlocks": 27,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8378f4d2e2f53d8d",
      "translationZh": "我一直在实验，想看看 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 的预训练 PLE n-gram 记忆能否改进规模小得多的 Qwen3.5-0.8B 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1056d3c209367030",
      "translationZh": "我在资源有限的情况下训练了这套 0.8B 配置，主要使用免费的 Kaggle 笔记本 GPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10b1ffe9c9e4e166",
      "translationZh": "这套配置将 Qwen3.5-0.8B 主干和参数量约为 51B 的 PLE 记忆都保持冻结。在解码器第 3 层和第 9 层训练一个小型 R=1 读取器，并由一个依赖 token 的线性门控控制后续注入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b96a7ae1806e166",
      "translationZh": "没有对主干进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "744c06a6ff66e72f",
      "translationZh": "当前的均衡版检查点使用了一个经过 15M 个 token 训练的读取器，以及一个单独校准的动态门控。在固定不变的完整验证集上：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d13f59fe2d69cd9f",
      "translationZh": "困惑度降低：5.05%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86f04fff6c6fd297",
      "translationZh": "这是语言模型的验证结果，并不是声称基准测试准确率提高了 5%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14a994d45be069f6",
      "translationZh": "有几项发现影响了最终设计：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74c21a2879e8c84b",
      "translationZh": "真正经过预训练的 PLE 优于随机记忆和打乱记忆这两种对照。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93105b05954dc931",
      "translationZh": "即使训练 token 数远超 5M，读取器的损失仍在持续改善。20M 读取器进一步降低了总体 LM 损失，但数学表现有所退步，因此 15M 仍是兼顾各方面表现的检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05df201ead43f2e1",
      "translationZh": "在靠后层进行强度较高的固定记忆注入损害了 LAMBADA 表现。动态的 token 级仲裁在很大程度上缓解了这一权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f60b6450e7af59c",
      "translationZh": "门控确实是动态的：其记忆强度在不同 token 之间有显著变化，而不是表现得像一个学习得到的常数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "456511999e2c605a",
      "translationZh": "在完全相同的记忆预算下，学习得到的 token 放置方式优于打乱后的放置方式。将记忆路由到高不确定性位置，恢复了部分优势，但仍未达到学习得到的门控的水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fd4a0aaf9ef2856",
      "translationZh": "经过热启动的 R=4 读取器使总体 LM 损失略有改善，但导致代码和数学表现退步。因此，我保留了 R=1，作为兼顾各方面表现的架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ba7f3e1bdf87d55",
      "translationZh": "我还在 llama.cpp 中实现了推理路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d84a58ba6e65a3cd",
      "translationZh": "公开的产物包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b7bdab434e047e5",
      "translationZh": "训练、控制与评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49ce8cd6676df711",
      "translationZh": "修改后的 llama.cpp 运行时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0f69286344053ad",
      "translationZh": "同样的方法，而且确实有效：困惑度降低了 3.7–4%。随着骨干模型变大，收益似乎会变小。它也能在我的 llama.cpp 分支上运行。如果你测试了它，请告诉我效果如何。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81a2a7f859ab2168",
      "translationZh": "GGUF 包含 Qwen3.5 骨干模型，以及训练好的读取器和仲裁张量。大型 PLE 仍作为外部量化配套文件存在，而不是打包进模型 GGUF 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d303b2f151b1991",
      "translationZh": "我还在一个单独的、固定的 WikiText-2 GGUF 运行时测试中测试了量化后的收益保留情况：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f48a47587c8690bc",
      "translationZh": "Q8_0 保留了 BF16 读取器 NLL 收益的 99.1%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0b616788bc5973e",
      "translationZh": "这是一次单独的运行时测量，并非上文所述的冻结 Kaggle 验证基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "032c0e2a45be356b",
      "translationZh": "欢迎尝试复现或改进读取器、PLE 缓存、路由或运行时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df98ced6080dd391",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我想尝试更大的 Qwen 骨干模型，尤其是 35B-A3B MoE。在这一规模上开展实验所需的计算资源，远超免费 Kaggle 笔记本所能提供的水平，但这项 0.8B 研究为读取器规模扩展和动态记忆仲裁提供了清晰得多的方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb9683fdc6392b1b",
      "translationZh": "披露声明：我是 Qwengram 及文中所链接代码仓库的作者。英语不是我的母语，因此我使用了 AI 来帮助校对本文的语法并改善措辞。实验本身的开发也得到了编程智能体的协助，主要是 ChatGPT Sol，用于实现、调试、实验编排和分析支持。我设计了实验、作出了研究决策、审查了结果，并对最终结论负责。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72422bb1f5c5af91",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Nicolodeva 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
